    "preview": "This appendix collects the reference data the working sections refer to, in one place you can keep open beside the calculator and the 3D models. Every table is consistent with the IEC&nbsp;60076 series and ordinary GCC utility practice; treat the ranges as engineering norms, not contractual values — always confirm against the governing standard and the customer specification.",
